1532
01:42:43.895 --> 01:42:46.164
All right. All right?

1533
01:42:48.199 --> 01:42:49.568
Najeeb?

1534
01:42:50.703 --> 01:42:53.569
Come on. Let it out, man.
Come on.

1535
01:42:53.571 --> 01:42:55.537
Let it out.

1536
01:42:55.539 --> 01:42:57.640
We gotta go. We gotta go.

1537
